[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090593327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4090593327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117606","id":4090593327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7z0YAv","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T14:36:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T14:36:07Z","body":"I wonder why `_edit.snap` needs to exist in the first place. My understanding is the `_edit` structure is for preserving some state during a transform, while snapping is something that can change mid transform.\r\n\r\nAll of these comparisons of `_edit.snap` or `spatial_editor->is_snap_enabled()` is what led to things getting out sync and this bug, and the current state of this PR seems to force it to sync. I would investigate if it can just be removed entirely and have `spatial_editor->is_snap_enabled()` as the only evaluated condition. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4090593327/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4094744134","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4094744134","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117606","id":4094744134,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70ENZG","user":{"login":"danbolt","id":1205433,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDU0MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1205433?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt","html_url":"https://github.com/danbolt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T01:24:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T01:24:10Z","body":"> I wonder why `_edit.snap` needs to exist in the first place. My understanding is the `_edit` structure is for preserving some state during a transform, while snapping is something that can change mid transform.\r\n\r\nI didn't `git-blame` past e1811b689b6, but it looks like the idea of having snapping state stored in a struct might date back to `spatial_editor_plugin.h` in 0b806ee0fc9. \r\n\r\n> All of these comparisons of `_edit.snap` or `spatial_editor->is_snap_enabled()` is what led to things getting out sync and this bug, and the current state of this PR seems to force it to sync. I would investigate if it can just be removed entirely and have `spatial_editor->is_snap_enabled()` as the only evaluated condition.\r\n\r\nI agree; avoiding stateful bugs probably helps a lot here. I've amended my PR to do the following:\r\n1. Remove `snap` from `EditData`\r\n2. Replace all references with a call to `is_snap_enabled()`, which checks the snapping state on the fly\r\n\r\nFor testing, I transformed Node3D in the editor while pressing/releasing the Ctrl key. This enabled/disabled snapping as expected.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4094744134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4097347068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4097347068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117606","id":4097347068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70OI38","user":{"login":"danbolt","id":1205433,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDU0MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1205433?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt","html_url":"https://github.com/danbolt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danbolt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T11:21:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T11:41:53Z","body":"> **Note:** This also changes the behavior of `Ctrl` when `Use Snap` is enabled to **_NOT_** use snap, but this makes sense and aligns with how Blender handles things as well.\r\n\r\nI just double-checked now, and funny enough, this behavior already happens in the main branch, but only if the player starts adjusting the transform with `Ctrl` held down. I think this is because the `snap` flag was only being set once.\r\n\r\nRegardless, this change is more robust, since we don't store the aforementioned state.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4097347068/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099857859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4099857859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117606","id":4099857859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70Xt3D","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T17:41:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T17:41:22Z","body":"> All of these comparisons of `_edit.snap` or `spatial_editor->is_snap_enabled()` is what led to things getting out sync and this bug,\r\n\r\nReached the same conclusion when triaging this issue.\r\n\r\nI should have checked GitHub beforehand lol. An approved fix after a day of reporting is fast! Thank you for the fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099857859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4113908892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4113908892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117606","id":4113908892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71NUSc","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.